('quant', 'percentages', 'A student needs 36% to pass. He scores 170 marks and fails by 37 marks. What are the maximum marks?', '["575","287.5","517","691"]'::jsonb, 0, 'Pass marks = 170 + 37 = 207 = 36% of maximum. Maximum = 207 × 100/36 = 575.', 'hard'),
