('quant', 'averages', 'A batsman scores 72 runs in his 13th innings and thereby increases his average by 3. What is his average after the 13th innings?', '["42","5.54","39","36"]'::jsonb, 3, 'New average = score - (innings - 1) × increase = 72 - 12×3 = 36.', 'medium'),
