('quant', 'averages', 'A batsman scores 72 runs in his 18th innings and thereby increases his average by 4. What is his average after the 18th innings?', '["8","12","0","4"]'::jsonb, 3, 'New average = score - (innings - 1) × increase = 72 - 17×4 = 4.', 'medium'),
