('quant', 'averages', 'The average of 14 numbers is 56. If one number is removed, the average of the rest becomes 53. What number was removed?', '["125","95","75","47.5"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Removed = 14×56 - 13×53 = 784 - 689 = 95.', 'medium'),
