('quant', 'averages', 'The average of 10 observations was 51. It was later found that one observation 82 was wrongly recorded instead of 104. Find the correct average.', '["54.2","48.8","53.2","73"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Correct total = 10×51 - 82 + 104 = 532. Average = 53.2.', 'hard'),
('quant', 'averages', 'The average weight of A and B is 53 kg, of B and C is 58 kg, and of C and A is 59 kg. Find A''s weight.', '["53 kg","54 kg","51 kg","56 kg"]'::jsonb, 1, 'A + B = 106, B + C = 116, C + A = 118. Adding: A + B + C = 170. A = 170 - (B + C) = 170 - 116 = 54.', 'hard'),
('quant', 'averages', 'The average age of 34 students is 13 years. When the teacher''s age is included, the average increases by 1 year. What is the teacher''s age?', '["60 years","48 years","49 years","47 years"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Teacher = new avg × (n+1) - old total = 14×35 - 13×34 = 48.', 'hard'),
('quant', 'averages', 'The average of 7 observations was 53. It was later found that one observation 52 was wrongly recorded instead of 40. Find the correct average.', '["54.71","53","41","51.29"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Correct total = 7×53 - 52 + 40 = 359. Average = 51.29.', 'hard'),
('quant', 'averages', 'The average weight of A and B is 43 kg, of B and C is 47 kg, and of C and A is 45 kg. Find A''s weight.', '["38 kg","43 kg","41 kg","45 kg"]'::jsonb, 2, 'A + B = 86, B + C = 94, C + A = 90. Adding: A + B + C = 135. A = 135 - (B + C) = 135 - 94 = 41.', 'hard'),
