('logical', 'coding-and-decoding', 'If WORK is coded as XNSJ, how is JUMP coded?', '["KVNQ","KTNO","ONTK","IVLQ"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Letters in odd positions move +1, letters in even positions move -1. JUMP → KTNO.', 'medium'),
