('verbal', 'active-and-passive-voice', 'Change into passive voice: "The students will perform the experiment."', '["The experiment was performed by the students.","The experiment is performed by the students.","The experiment has been performed by the students.","The experiment will be performed by the students."]'::jsonb, 3, 'Simple future active → passive uses "will be + past participle (performed)". Object becomes subject: The experiment will be performed by the students.', 'hard'),
