('verbal', 'active-and-passive-voice', 'Change into passive voice: "The teacher will check the papers."', '["The papers were checked by the teacher.","The papers will be checked by the teacher.","The papers have been checked by the teacher.","The papers are being checked by the teacher."]'::jsonb, 1, 'Simple future active → passive uses "will be + past participle (checked)". Object becomes subject: The papers will be checked by the teacher.', 'hard'),
