('verbal', 'active-and-passive-voice', 'Change into passive voice: "My mother is baking the cake."', '["The cake has been baked by my mother.","The cake is being baked by my mother.","The cake is baked by my mother.","The cake will be baked by my mother."]'::jsonb, 1, 'Present continuous active → passive uses "is being + past participle (baked)". Object becomes subject: The cake is being baked by my mother.', 'hard'),
