((SELECT id FROM assessments WHERE slug = 'placement-mock-1'), 'Change into indirect speech: He said to me, "Where do you live?"', '["He said to me where I live.","He asked me where I lived.","He asked me where did I live.","He asked me where do you live."]'::jsonb, 1, 'Reporting verb in past → backshift tenses and change pronouns/time words. Correct: He asked me where I lived.', 'direct-and-indirect-speech', 11),
